id: pm-l6bpb8
title: Complete bounded discovery and read-only recovery proof for missing assurance declarations
description: "GitHub #1527 independently reproduces the missing-declaration fault addressed by the closed typed-refusal owner. The current built fix returns a typed usage error but still advertises only generic help, so complete the remaining bounded same-tracker discovery and refusal byte-preservation criteria without reopening shipped mutation/field-validation work. https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1527"
