  "2026-10-20T21:57:09.432Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: fresh open/in-progress inventories, all-status assurance declaration discovery recovery search and the strict complete 3033-item corpus identify no dedicated remaining discovery owner. Full live parent and all three predecessor records were read. The closed typed lookup, put/remove mutation and field-validation fixes remain completed; this task owns the remaining GitHub #1527 recovery and read-only proof criteria. The issue was created during the ongoing delivery and found by the complete paginated GitHub audit."
  "2026-10-20T22:17:25.152Z","harness:codex","Validation: four enhanced missing-declaration cases failed before bounded guidance and now pass. Linked sandbox suite passes all 38 tests (11 registry, 19 action, 8 CLI); CLI discovery is replayed against a selected tracker with spaces while the ambient tracker differs, and every selected tracker file remains byte-identical. Built Node and Bun each pass seven usage-refusal controls (three show kinds, promote and three remove kinds), replay all four executable discovery commands, and verify public SDK typed reads plus SDK/MCP dispatch without registry/history changes. Expected misses are excluded by the production Sentry capture predicate; corrupt registry, EACCES and unexpected TypeError controls retain genuine fault classification. Coherent build, typecheck, targeted ESLint and SDK snapshot check pass; the public surface has zero classified changes. GitHub #1527 is linked to this recovery task and the completed typed-refusal predecessor; the current PR will close it after reviewed merge. Source work remains Unreleased."
